      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/styles/today.css",
      "content": "Applying `overflow-wrap: anywhere` to every data cell also allows breaks inside monetary figures and provenance dates/times. `MarkValue` renders its price in an unprotected `\u003cspan\u003e`, and Change is bare text, so sufficiently long values can be split mid-number when the table is compressed at 320 px. This violates the requirement to preserve figures/dates. Scope arbitrary wrapping to labels and prose, and protect numeric tokens (including Change) with scoped nonbreaking styles while retaining wrapping between provenance components.",
